## Why This Is Asked
This tests cross-region cache coherence, multi-tier invalidation, and stampede protection with Redis and Memcached.

## Key Concepts
- Cross-datacenter invalidation with Redis Pub/Sub
- Per-entity invalidation keys and TTL design
- Write-through vs write-behind
- Stampede prevention with per-key locking and coordinated invalidation

## Code Example
```javascript
// Publisher
redis.publish('invalidate:entity:123', JSON.stringify({entityId:123, type:'user'}));

// Subscriber (cache layer)
redis.subscribe('invalidate:entity:123');
redis.on('message', (_, msg) => {
  const data = JSON.parse(msg);
  cacheEvict(`entity:${data.entityId}`);
});
```

